<title>USA: DLB Oil consumates WRT reorganisation plan.</title>
<headline>DLB Oil consumates WRT reorganisation plan.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>DLB Oil &amp; Gas Inc said it had consumated a reorganisation plan for WRT Energy Corp, of which WRT, DLB and Wexford Management LLC on behalf of its affiliated investment funds were co-proponents.</p>
<p>DLB issued a news release saying WRT Energy Corp was now a Delaware corporation and will have a total of 2O.O4 million shares issued and outstanding.</p>
<p>DLB said it owns 10.35 million shares.</p>
<p>Wexford Management LLC owns 1.84 million shares, the release said.</p>
<p>An additional 1.41 million shares, currently in escrow, will be distributed upon resolution of certain post closing matters, the release said.</p>
